# S06: App Agent Execution Loop

## App-agent protocol

All tasks in this sprint follow `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md`.
Code tasks use `templates/PD-APP-AGENT-BLOCK.md`.

## Objective

Close the Totem × app-agent × work-control loop: MCP preflight, slug/knowledge/doc layers,
and protocol fields on every plan — then replace mock agents with real LLM behind the same
`Agent` interface (S05 roadmap).

## Foundation decisions (frozen — see S06-INVARIANTS.md)

- **Protocol:** `INSTANCE.ti` + `APP-AGENT-PROTOCOL.md` mandatory on every role.
- **totem-writer:** inject `protocol`, `requires`, and PD block into generated `.pd` files.
- **LLM:** reuse `createModelForId` / `integrations` slug; mock fallback when env unset.
- **Gates unchanged:** Accept ≠ run; human opens gate; 423 while OPEN.

